= render 'shared/breakthrough_page', page_title: 'CunningFX', current_page: 'CunningFX', page_subtitle: 'Advanced features for the Baldrick8 web interface', document_title: 'CunningFX - Baldrick8 Web Interface Feature', meta: ['Built-in effects', 'Layered presets', 'No show player required'], toc: cunningfx_toc do
  p.lead With more of our customers using Baldrick Boards for everything from house outlines, light art installations and commercial buildings, we needed a way to generate effects without the need for a show player.

  .prose
    section#introduction
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Overview
        | Introduction

      figure.figure
        .fimg
          = image_tag 'cunningfx/presets-overview.png', alt: 'CunningFX presets overview in the web interface'
        figcaption CunningFX presets in the Baldrick web interface — layered effects without a show player.

    section#presets
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Layers
        | Presets

      p Presets are collections of effects that run at the same time. They work like layers in an image editor — effects are stacked from top to bottom, and the one on top always takes priority. This means you can apply several effects to the same set of pixels.
      p For example, if you were lighting the outline of a room, you might use a base effect to give everything a single colour, then place another effect on top to highlight the doors.

    section#effects
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Building blocks
        | Effects

      p Effects are the building blocks of CunningFX. You can attach an effect to either the whole controller, a port or a single model. Most effects will have modifiers such as Colour, Speed and Reverse which change the colours, the speed and reverse the effect.

      figure.figure
        .fimg
          = image_tag 'cunningfx/effects-overview.png', alt: 'CunningFX effects overview'
        figcaption Attach effects to the whole controller, a port or an individual model.

      .fx-block#colour-splash
        h3 Colour Splash
        p.fx-desc Colour splash rotates throughout the selected colours evenly fading between each one starting at the top and going down the list.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/colour-splash.png', alt: 'Colour Splash effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'colour-splash-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Colour Splash effect in action'

      .fx-block#rainbow
        h3 Rainbow
        p.fx-desc A rainbow effect smoothly cycles through red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet, blending each hue into the next to create a continuous, mesmerising loop of shifting colours.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/rainbow.png', alt: 'Rainbow effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'rainbow-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Rainbow effect in action'

      .fx-block#twinkle
        h3 Twinkle
        p.fx-desc You can select a background colour for the pixels and up to five colours to twinkle against that wonderful background colour you've chosen (we recommend black but you do you).
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/twinkle.png', alt: 'Twinkle effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'twinkle-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Twinkle effect in action'

      .fx-block#bounce
        h3 Bounce
        p.fx-desc The pixels will light from one side of the string to the other — imagine a game of pong but in 2D and you can neither win nor lose.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/bounce.png', alt: 'Bounce effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'bounce-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Bounce effect in action'

      .fx-block#alternate
        h3 Alternate
        p.fx-desc Imagine a Can-Can of pixels that you can choose up to five colours and have them as large as you'd like.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/alternate.png', alt: 'Alternate effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'alternate-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Alternate effect in action'

      .fx-block#fader
        h3 Fader
        p.fx-desc Fades smoothly between two colours.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/fader.png', alt: 'Fader effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'fader-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'Fader effect in action'

      .fx-block#on-off
        h3 On / Off
        p.fx-desc Imagine the fader but with one colour and not fading — yeah it goes on / off / on / off.
        .fx-media
          .media-slot
            = image_tag 'cunningfx/on-off.png', alt: 'On/Off effect settings'
          .media-slot
            = video_tag 'on-off-effect.mp4', controls: true, alt: 'On/Off effect in action'

    section#turnip-network
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Integration
        | Turnip Network integration

      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
            path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
        div
          span.lbl Network triggers
          p.bd
            | CunningFX can be activated over the
            = link_to ' Turnip Network', breakthroughs_turnip_network_path
            |  so your
            = link_to ' Input1', board_path('baldrickinput1')
            |  and
            = link_to ' Baldrick8', board_path('baldrick8')
            |  buttons can toggle presets.

    h2
      span.hk
        span.bar
        span.annot Keep reading
      | Related breakthroughs

    .next-grid
      = link_to breakthroughs_busk_board_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 Busk Board
        p Trigger CunningFX presets from buttons on your phone or tablet.
      = link_to breakthroughs_turniput_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 Turniput
        p Trigger presets from physical inputs across the network.
      = link_to board_path('baldrick8'), class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Docs
          span.go →
        h4 Baldrick8
        p The board CunningFX was built for.
      = link_to breakthroughs_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Index
          span.go →
        h4 All breakthroughs
        p Explore everything that makes Baldrick boards a bit special.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Effects without the show player
    p Layer presets in the web interface, or trigger them from a Turniput across the network.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to board_path('baldrick8'), class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Meet the Baldrick8
        span.ar →
      = link_to breakthroughs_turniput_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | Turniput inputs
